  "notes": "Classic Era community-standard builds. Priests raid as Holy healers (Discipline for Divine Spirit, Inner Focus and Mental Agility); Discipline/Holy with Power Infusion is the late-game alternative; Shadow is for PvP and leveling. Allocations validated against the Classic tree data.",
